––– comment –––
A failed delivery: node 2 can not receive the chunk (its staging root is a regular file), the reserve fails there, the commit fails, the other nodes drop the chunk by its abort, no node attaches anything and the files seqno does not change; the next load after the fix works
––– input –––
source /tmp/bc.sh; add td; R=/var/log/manticore-2/td/td.indexer-rt-bulk; rm -rf $R; touch $R; load 1 td 1 1000
