––– comment –––
A node away at the commit: the chunk goes to the nodes in the view only; the node comes back, refuses IST on the files seqno and rejoins by SST without a restart (P1), then has the rows. Node 3 is paused last, so the cases above keep three nodes
––– input –––
source /tmp/bc.sh; add ta
––– output –––
add ta 0
––– block: ../base/replication/rejoin-pause-node3 –––
